{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_057EE0","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"我先说明一下Metal Gear <R=ZEKE,ZEKE>的语音合成系统。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=ZEKE,ZEKE>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":66,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"语音合成系统？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":21,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"普通兵器由驾驶员开口说话就行，但自主行动的AI兵器没有驾驶员。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":89,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"如果AI兵器自己不把状况传达给周围，就无法和附近的步兵协同行动。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":92,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"确实。即使在战场上，语言交流也很重要。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":57,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"所以AI兵器都会搭载语音合成系统。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":47,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"不过，能凭自己的意志进行对话的，只有Peace Walker。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":69,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"其他AI只是根据状况说出预先设定好的话。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":56,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"<R=ZEKE,ZEKE>也是一样，不过只要你事先准备好语音，就能在想用的时候调用。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=ZEKE,ZEKE>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":100,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"想准备语音的话，从<R=附加内容,EXTRAS>菜单进入EDIT模式就行。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=附加内容,EXTRAS>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":81,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":10,"cn_text":"准备得还真周到。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":24,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":11,"cn_text":"还可以让它唱歌。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":24,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":12,"cn_text":"唱歌？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":9,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":13,"cn_text":"歌很重要。那时我切身体会到了歌的力量。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":57,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":14,"cn_text":"不过，<R=ZEKE,ZEKE>的AI不会凭自己的意志唱歌。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=ZEKE,ZEKE>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":60,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":15,"cn_text":"它终究只会播放预先准备好的歌曲。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":48,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":16,"cn_text":"Snake，作曲对你来说大概太难了……不过歌词倒可以随你喜欢地改。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":89,"review_flag":""}]}